OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud and a
OL,6,Ffew bright or sunny spells today.
OL,7,FShowers across Argyll at first will
OL,8,Fbreak out more widely during the
OL,9,Fmorning and afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FShowers mostly dying out this
OL,12,Fevening, although a few continuing
OL,13,Fovernight across the west. Otherwise a
OL,14,Fdry night with variable amounts of
OL,15,Fcloud and clear periods.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FMainly dry with a few bright
OL,18,Fspells and just a few light showers,
OL,19,Fthese mainly across Argyll.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
